---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

{/* `.tds-tone-navy` carries the fill AND re-maps the page tokens inside the
    footer. It used to also draw a `border-t` in the re-mapped `--color-line`;
    on a flat surface that line is redundant, because a navy ground against the
    light canvas already separates by fill alone — which is the only thing that
    ever made the border invisible enough to look right. */}
<footer class="mt-20 tds-tone-navy">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-extrabold">TDS Tools</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">
        Kostenlose digitale Werkzeuge für die Digitalisierung — direkt im Browser.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="mb-2 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/60">Tracht Digital Solutions</p>
      <p class="text-white/80">Julian Tracht<br />21493 Schwarzenbek bei Hamburg</p>
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm">
      <p class="mb-2 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/60">Rechtliches</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1">
        <li><a class="text-white/80 no-underline hover:text-white" href="https://tracht-digital.de/legal/impressum">Impressum</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-white/80 no-underline hover:text-white" href="https://tracht-digital.de/legal/datenschutz">Datenschutz</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-white/80 no-underline hover:text-white" href="https://tracht-digital.de">tracht-digital.de</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  {/* The copyright bar was split off with a `border-t`. Flat trades the line
      for a tone STEP — a slightly deeper navy plus the padding it already had.
      A fill only separates against a different ground, and here it does. */}
  <div class="bg-black/15 px-4 py-4 text-center text-xs text-white/50 sm:px-6">
    © {year} Tracht Digital Solutions · Digitalisierung für Unternehmen
  </div>
</footer>
